VISION portable mode is enabled by the presence of this file.

VISION — built by SPIRIT ORG

When VISION.exe runs from this folder, it stores:
- configuration, history, logs, model, llama.cpp, skills and WebView2 profile in .\data
- tool workspace files in .\workspace

Do not delete this marker unless you want VISION to return to the standard
Windows per-user data locations. For security, API keys and Hugging Face
tokens are still kept in Windows Credential Manager rather than this folder.
